   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">In October 2017 one-week study visit to SSM and Swedish RWM facilities was carried out for a Ukrainian delegation consisting of representatives of Ukrainian Parliament, Ministry of Environment, Agency for Management of the Exclusive Zone of Chernobyl and State Corporation Radon &#x2013; Ukrainian operator of radioactive waste and disused radioactive sources. The visit included SKB facilities SFR in Forsmark and Clab in Oskarshamn, as well as Studsvik. One-day workshop at SSM had been devoted to Swedish national system for management of radioactive waste and the project for final disposal of spent nuclear fuel.</narrative>
   </description>
